\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   This is the day I was born.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And I see the light of the world.
\par If I check my energy,
\par And all what God does for me too.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Then I ask what shall be my
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Thanksgiving?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. It is God who gave me life,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  And all things that I may need too;
\par What I shall drink and will eat,
\par He keeps watch and let me live long.
\par For He gives me all my needs,
\par Than my thanks.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Created  me not in vain;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj created me in your glory,
\par You were my good Redeemer,
\par Who showed me paths of righteousness.
\par My Lord, kindly strengthen me,
\par All the days.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  My good Lord, since I have life,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I will always glorify you.
\par Yes, since you're my Redeemer,
\par I give to you all the glory.
\par Let me give you the honour,
\par This day too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Safeguard me oh my good Lord,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And let me be Thine for ever,
\par Take me as a sacrifice,
\par Given to you this day, my Lord,
\par All I have belongs to Thee,
\par \pard     I've nothing. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

